# figoya-site baseline: deviations from the rules that this site accepts for now.
# One per line: rule <tab> file <tab> message. `figoya-site check` fails on anything
# not listed here and reports lines that no longer apply. Regenerate with
# `figoya-site check --update-baseline`; remove lines as you fix things.
